(function(payload){if(typeof applySerialChapterPayload==="function")applySerialChapterPayload(payload);else (window.SERIAL_CHAPTER_QUEUE||(window.SERIAL_CHAPTER_QUEUE=[])).push(payload);})({"id":"serial-mystery-60","book":"seventh-wharf","cn":["接收点愿意[[regenerate|重建]]山城的供给记录，但那份表里还有[[latent|潜在的]]缺口。杜医生很[[stubborn|执拗]]，要先[[formulate|规划]]接续安排，才同我们告别。灯的[[fuse|保险丝]]换好，桌边一件慈善[[ornament|装饰品]]也撤下；它不再能当作问钱从哪来的[[pretext|借口]]。一个家属取饭时险些[[tumble|跌倒]]，老陈扶住她。她担心新[[appropriation|拨款]]到账之前失去床位。杜医生说[[henceforth|从今以后]]每笔捐助和物资各记一栏，愿意留下的是真帮助，不是不能询问的名字。家属把碗稳稳放到桌上，第一次敢问还要等几天。","我从[[wallet|皮夹]]里拿出自己的车票，不能拿病人的经历去[[unify|统一]]所有猜测。程雾说没有[[eternal|永远的]]好人标签，也没有一笔援助能[[foster|培养]]永久沉默。三个村里[[prevalent|普遍的]]担忧，不能只用[[incidence|发生率]]安抚。厨房重新收了[[cucumber|黄瓜]]，基金旧表的[[aviation|航空]]补给栏却仍指向海上塔站。那个栏里的星号[[denote|表示]]先核实验再付款。我们要追的不是一场到处[[propagate|传播]]的故事，而是这个星号与实货的不同步。杜医生把它圈起来，留下我们说话时的时间。","基金的宣传照片强调白塔的[[majesty|雄伟]]，经理还想[[flatter|奉承]]接收负责人，未能取消封存。缺失的原表会[[necessitate|使成为必要]]登岛，但[[orthodox|传统的]]纸档仍要留在山城。我们在[[lounge|休息室]]与接收[[corps|队伍]]核对签字，等检验部门将样品结果与病册[[correlate|关联]]。有人建议[[boycott|抵制]]一切基金援助，杜医生拒绝：车的[[velocity|速度]]再快，也不能越过每个[[pedestrian|行人]]真实的饥饿。撤掉货物风险与撤掉孩子早餐不是同一回事，他为这句话争了整整一个上午。","目录有[[radioactive|放射性的]]仪器旧分类，描述[[ambiguous|含糊的]]，我差点[[impulsive|冲动地]]向家属喊出危险名称。程雾挡住我，说[[qualitative|定性的]]描述不能代替检验。我们需要的[[intellect|理解力]]是承认范围，不是读懂一个词就说懂了箱子。接收点原是一座[[chapel|小教堂]]，现在由本地[[subsidiary|附属机构]]使用；它不在基金的[[domain|领地]]内。志愿者用旧[[census|人口统计]]核对住址，不追问孩子能否作证。我们把能说和不能说的部分解释清楚，家属的声音这才慢慢降下来。","车辆清洁页的改写是[[willful|故意的]]，司机愿意[[depict|描述]]经过，但说自己只负责两段短途[[hop|运输]]。岛路是谁[[pave|铺筑]]的、谁签货，要到白塔查。交接不是可删去的边角，而是批次链的[[integral|必要组成的]]一段。老陈替轮椅[[lubricate|润滑]]轴，接收点墙上[[medieval|中世纪的]]壁画被帘子遮住，外面一艘[[tanker|油轮]]慢慢离岸。这种[[transition|过渡]]没有戏剧性的掌声；有人仍会[[repel|排斥]]我们的询问，手里的旧[[junk|废物]]也未变成宝藏。可轮椅终于不再卡在门槛上，这就够我们先安稳吃一顿饭。","傍晚杜医生将山城病册副本锁入新柜，把原册交接收条贴在柜门里。六孩的接收单位逐名确认，护工也拿回村里可公开的记录。程雾在门口给他们录了一段没有姓名的晚饭声，留作他们自己愿意保存的记忆。我们明天坐早渡去岛上白塔，杜医生留下继续照顾病人；他不再必须用远行证明自己的勇敢。临走他叫住我，说替他问实验员一句，那箱退样到过哪里。我答应问清每一处停留，而不是替他们带回一个显得完整的答案。老陈把冷了的面重新端上桌，说先吃，海不会因为我们饿着就退得更快。"],"en":["The receiving service would [[regenerate|regenerate]] supply records, but [[latent|latent]] omissions remained. [[stubborn|Stubborn]] Du would [[formulate|formulate]] continuity before farewells. After replacing a lamp [[fuse|fuse]], staff removed a charity [[ornament|ornament]] that had become a [[pretext|pretext]] against financial questions. A relative nearly took a [[tumble|tumble]] collecting food. Chen caught her. Would delayed [[appropriation|appropriation]] cost their beds? [[henceforth|Henceforth]], Du promised, money and goods would occupy separate columns. Real help could remain open to inquiry. She set down her bowl and asked how many days remained.","Taking a ticket from my [[wallet|wallet]], I resisted trying to [[unify|unify]] every suspicion through patients' experiences. No label was [[eternal|eternal]], Cheng said; aid must not [[foster|foster]] permanent silence. [[prevalent|Prevalent]] worries across three villages required more than an [[incidence|incidence]] figure. Fresh [[cucumber|cucumber]] reached the kitchen, while an old [[aviation|aviation]] supply column pointed to the offshore station. Its star would [[denote|denote]] experimental verification before payment. We sought that star's mismatch with goods, not a story to [[propagate|propagate]] everywhere. Du circled it and recorded our discussion time.","Photographs emphasized the tower's [[majesty|majesty]]. Attempts to [[flatter|flatter]] the receiving director failed to undo sealing. Missing originals would [[necessitate|necessitate]] an island trip, but [[orthodox|orthodox]] paper records stayed here. In the [[lounge|lounge]] we checked signatures with the receiving [[corps|corps]], awaiting examination to [[correlate|correlate]] samples with clinical records. Du rejected a [[boycott|boycott]] of all aid. Truck [[velocity|velocity]] must never override a hungry [[pedestrian|pedestrian]]. Removing cargo risks must not remove breakfast; he spent the morning securing that distinction.","A [[radioactive|radioactive]] instrument category in the catalogue was [[ambiguous|ambiguous]]. I almost made an [[impulsive|impulsive]] announcement. Cheng stopped me: a [[qualitative|qualitative]] description was no test. [[intellect|Intellect]] meant recognizing limits. The reception building, once a [[chapel|chapel]], housed a local [[subsidiary|subsidiary]] outside the fund's [[domain|domain]]. Volunteers checked addresses against an old [[census|census]] without asking children for testimony. We explained what could be stated and what remained unknown. Families gradually lowered their voices, now able to hear the arrangements instead of competing rumours.","The cleaning alteration was [[willful|willful]]. The driver would [[depict|depict]] it, but knew only two transport [[hop|hops]]. We would ask White Tower who had [[pave|paved]] the island route and signed deliveries. Transfers formed an [[integral|integral]] chain. Chen helped [[lubricate|lubricate]] wheelchair axles. A curtain covered a [[medieval|medieval]] mural while a [[tanker|tanker]] left outside. This [[transition|transition]] earned no theatrical applause. People might [[repel|repel]] our questions; old [[junk|junk]] remained ordinary. Yet the wheelchair crossed the threshold freely, allowing its owner to eat in comfort.","At evening Du locked working copies away and posted the original's transfer receipt inside. The service confirmed all six children's names; the care worker recovered releasable village records. With permission Cheng recorded anonymous supper sounds for their own memories. Tomorrow we would take the early island ferry. Du stayed with patients, needing no journey to demonstrate courage. He asked us to find every place the sample box had visited. I promised locations, not an answer merely shaped to look complete. Chen brought reheated noodles: starving would not make the sea retreat faster."]});
